LAMMPS (10 Dec 2025)
KOKKOS mode with Kokkos version 4.7.1 is enabled
  using double precision
  using view layout = legacy
  will use up to 1 GPU(s) per node
WARNING: When using a single thread, the Kokkos Serial backend (i.e. Makefile.kokkos_mpi_only) gives better performance than the OpenMP backend (src/KOKKOS/kokkos.cpp:266)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
package kokkos
package kokkos neigh half newton on
# =============================================================================
# LAMMPS input script for PDMS melt-quench densification
# =============================================================================
# ALIGNED VERSION (Ref: DONE2) - Target: 1.10 g/cm³
#
# Key improvements from DONE2:
# 1. Proven stability with tdamp=0.5, pdamp=10.0
# 2. Peak temperature capped at 500K for numerical stability
# 3. High-pressure hold (5 GPa) with gradual decompression/cooling
# 4. Multi-stage release to minimize density rebound
# =============================================================================

log             melt_quench_log.lammps
